  "text_sample": "Your Page Title aubergine projects menu aubergine close Services Projects Garden care About Areas Journal Free quote Overview +34 960 000 000 [email protected] Cam\u00ed de Vera 18, 46022 Valencia Joan Ribera Founder, stone and build, since 2011 Joan grew up in Sagunto building dry stone walls with his father, on the terraces behind the family\u2019s orange groves. He trained as a mason, spent ten years on restoration work in the old towns of the coast, and still lays stone most weeks. He runs the build crews and every quote that involves a wall, a path or a step. If a stone on site can be reused, Joan will find a place for it. About the company Written by Joan Notes for the journal, from the work itself. 4 December 2025 , Building How a dry stone wall drains No cement, no weep holes, and still standing after a hundred winters. The way the old terraces were built, and why we build them the same way. Building Also on the team Ingrid Halvorsen Founder, head of design Marta Llorens Head gardener Matteo Bassi Irrigation and lighting The first visit is free An hour in your garden with Ingrid Halvorsen, our head of design. You keep the ideas and a rough price range. Free quote +34 960 000 000 Gard",
